    /// or [`#AUDIOSUITE_ERROR_INVALID_STATE`] if pipline state is invalid, e.g. can not find output node, e.t.c.
    /// or [`#AUDIOSUITE_ERROR_NODE_NOT_EXIST`] if audioNode does not exist or has been destroyed.
    /// or [`#AUDIOSUITE_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED_CONNECT`] if connections between two node types are not supported.
    /// or [`#AUDIOSUITE_ERROR_TIMEOUT`] if an operation times out before completion.
    /// or [`#AUDIOSUITE_ERROR_SYSTEM`] if the system has other abnormalities.
    ///
    /// Available since API-level: 22
